sections.body:
保存为 motion-rank.mjs，用 node motion-rank.mjs 运行。features 的顺序固定为 [速度, 脚位]；返回新排序记录，不修改输入。同分按 ID 排序，没有同支撑脚候选就返回空数组。另放一个数值完全匹配、但支撑脚不符的 other-foot，确认硬条件先于距离。

```javascript
/**
 * @file Compare a small motion-feature catalog with explicit feature scales.
 * @author liliwei
 * @date 2026-11-04
 * @LastEditors liliwei
 * @LastEditTime 2026-11-04
 */

/**
 * Rank compatible frames; this is ordinary search, not a neural model.
 * @param {{features:number[], contact:string}} query [speed, local foot position].
 * @param {Array<{id:string, features:number[], contact:string}>} frames Fixed catalog.
 * @param {number[]} scale Positive scales in the same units as the two features.
 * @returns {Array<{id:string, cost:number}>} Ascending cost; ties use the id.
 */
export function rankFrames(query, frames, scale) {
  const pair = v => Array.isArray(v) && v.length === 2 && [...v].every(Number.isFinite);
  const valid = v => v && pair(v.features) && ['L', 'R'].includes(v.contact);
  if (!valid(query) || !pair(scale) || scale.some(v => v <= 0) || !Array.isArray(frames)) {
    throw new TypeError('Invalid query, scales or catalog');
  }
  const ids = new Set(), result = [];
  for (const frame of frames) {
    if (!valid(frame) || typeof frame.id !== 'string' || !frame.id.trim() || ids.has(frame.id)) {
      throw new TypeError('Invalid or duplicate frame');
    }
    ids.add(frame.id);
    if (frame.contact !== query.contact) continue;
    const cost = frame.features.reduce((sum, v, j) => sum + ((v - query.features[j]) / scale[j]) ** 2, 0);
    if (!Number.isFinite(cost)) throw new RangeError('Feature cost overflow');
    result.push({id: frame.id, cost});
  }
  return result.sort((a, b) => a.cost - b.cost || (a.id < b.id ? -1 : a.id > b.id ? 1 : 0));
}

const query = {features: [3, 0.10], contact: 'L'};
const frames = [
  {id: 'slow', features: [1, 0.10], contact: 'L'},
  {id: 'run', features: [3, 0.20], contact: 'L'},
  {id: 'other-foot', features: [3, 0.10], contact: 'R'},
];
/** Convert only the position column from metres to centimetres. @returns {object} New row. */
const toCm = row => ({...row, features: [row.features[0], row.features[1] * 100]});
console.log(JSON.stringify({
  rawMetres: rankFrames(query, frames, [1, 1]),
  rawCentimetres: rankFrames(toCm(query), frames.map(toCm), [1, 1]),
  scaledMetres: rankFrames(query, frames, [1, 0.20]),
  scaledCentimetres: rankFrames(toCm(query), frames.map(toCm), [1, 20]),
}, null, 2));
```

raw 两档都把数字直接相加，故意没有维护物理尺度；scaled 两档才同时转换数据与尺度。函数只判断数值与 L/R 合同，不知道姿态是否自然。除法或平方溢出时拒绝本次查询，调用方应走备用动画。

可以把实际特征表交给已有编程助手审阅。它的工作是帮助找合同漏洞，不能代替动作观察：

```text
请审阅这份动作检索特征表和 rankFrames：
1. 列出每列单位、坐标系、采样时刻、尺度及兼容性条件。
2. 给出一组只换单位就改变未校准排名的反例，并手算贡献。
3. 检查数据与尺度一起换单位后，排名为什么应保持不变。
4. 提出一个“距离最小但不能播放”的反例及需要的独立验收。
不补造模型、动作画面或帧率结果，不修改原有动作许可。
```
